desc(
	mode: "source",
	language: "general",
	title: "Claude Settings Bypass Permissions Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Bypass Permissions Generic",
	type: vuln,
	level: critical,
	rule_id: "source-config-claude-settings-bypass-permissions-generic",
	risk: "Security",
	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `claude-settings-bypass-permissions-generic` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/ai/ai-best-practices/claude-settings-bypass-permissions/claude-settings-bypass-permissions.yaml).
Original message: Dangerous permission bypass detected in Claude Code or Cursor settings. Settings like "bypassPermissions", "allowUnsandboxedCommands: true", or "enableWeakerNestedSandbox: true" disable critical security controls that protect against malicious tool use. Remove these settings or set them to false to maintain proper sandboxing and permission checks.

CWE: CWE-862: Missing Authorization
References:
- https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/security
DESC,
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review the flagged code and follow the framework's secure coding guidance: use safe APIs, escape output, and avoid hardcoded credentials.
SOLUTION,
	alert_min: 1,
	"file://pos/settings.json": <<<POS
"bypassPermissions"

POS,
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG,
)

${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"bypassPermissions"/) as $p0
${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"allowUnsandboxedCommands"\s*:\s*true/) as $p1
${/.*\/settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"enableWeakerNestedSandbox"\s*:\s*true/) as $p2
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/"bypassPermissions"/) as $p3
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/"allowUnsandboxedCommands"\s*:\s*true/) as $p4
${/.*\/\.claude\/.*/}.pattern_regex(/"enableWeakerNestedSandbox"\s*:\s*true/) as $p5
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"bypassPermissions"/) as $p6
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"allowUnsandboxedCommands"\s*:\s*true/) as $p7
${/.*\/[^\/]*\.settings\.json/}.pattern_regex(/"enableWeakerNestedSandbox"\s*:\s*true/) as $p8
$p0 + $p1 + $p2 + $p3 + $p4 + $p5 + $p6 + $p7 + $p8 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "critical",
	title: "Claude Settings Bypass Permissions Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Claude Settings Bypass Permissions Generic",
	message: "Claude Settings Bypass Permissions Generic",
}
